  "name": "Cabbage Soup",
  "subtitle": "A hearty vegetable soup with chickpeas and smoky herbs",
  "description": "Savoy cabbage, vegetables, chickpeas, tomatoes, and herbs simmer together for a warming one-pot soup.",
